Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 22:26:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08/10] hunt stress0: the minimal form with the snapshot
 handles on threads of their own

Reader handles scan from threads while the writer puts and commits, so the
defect is reached whatever the writer's upkeep does; with the inline upkeep
the publisher is the commit itself. The loop script takes the test's name
from the environment, and the minimal form's header says where it was built.

